nd the vec-literal parser fix\n859bd55 Implement v[a:b] slices as index specs with jq clamping\n5928893 Fix vec literals being swallowed as indices after a definition\n4640b26 Land to-merge-1788116403: promote 5 commits (798 changed lines)\nddbbe5c Refuse a cycle between recursive-enum printers on jq\n2d2e691 Land issue-132: emit sys.setrecursionlimit in the Python backend (gh:132)\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"git log --oneline -15 -- src/","time":{"start":1788285579093,"end":1788285579095}},"id":"prt_05e206dfa001KaUxpRhlFWio5Y","sessionID":"ses_fa1e30e50ffeU2O2jnEUGTDEg1","messageID":"msg_05e201f14001nYSEQaWRV2ZGuq"}}
